{"id":"e982a8bf4a1e448d59bbb3a94eb35fe138b12557","axis":"silent","repo":"microsoft/onnxruntime","sha":"e982a8bf4a1e448d59bbb3a94eb35fe138b12557","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/design/webgpu_feature_options.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@","+# WebGPU execution provider feature options","+","+`enableFeatures` and `disableFeatures` control named ORT capabilities. JavaScript","+bindings accept arrays of strings:","+","+```ts","+executionProviders: [{ name: \"webgpu\", disableFeatures: [\"subgroupMatrix\"] }];","+```","+","+Native provider options accept comma-separated names under `enableFeatures` and","+`disableFeatures`. Session configuration keys use the prefix","+`ep.webgpuexecutionprovider.`. Empty lists use defaults. Whitespace around","+names is trimmed. Names are case sensitive; unknown names, duplicates, and names in both lists are rejected.","+","+Enabling permits use when the device supports a feature. It does not require","+hardware support or guarantee a particular kernel will execute. Disabling","+prevents this session from using the feature, including on externally supplied","+devices; it does not change the device itself.","+","+| Feature          | Default                | Scope                        | Behavior when disabled                                     |","+| ---------------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |","+| `subgroupMatrix` | Enabled when supported | Session                      | Existing fallback kernels replace subgroup matrix kernels. |","+","+Each session applies its own feature settings, independently of creation order.","+Omitted features use their defaults, including when sharing a context with a","+session that disables them. Settings remain fixed for the session's lifetime.","+","+The native `kWebGpuFeatures` registry defines supported names and defaults.","+It is independent of WebGPU device features. The shared context requests and","+caches supported device capabilities regardless of session feature settings.","+`ComputeContextBase::HasFeature` uses `WebGpuExecutionProvider::DeviceHasFeature`","+to filter those capabilities by the session's permissions when selecting kernels.","+Shader generation still uses the device's actual capabilities, so fallback","+shaders may contain an unused subgroup matrix extension declaration. Existing","+program keys distinguish matrix kernels from their fallbacks.","+The bindings forward lists without maintaining a second registry.","+Only capabilities that can be gated per session are registered today;","+future device-creation-only features need separate lifecycle handling and","+documented scope. Numeric and enum settings remain explicit typed options."],"additions":39,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"js/common/lib/inference-session.ts","lines":["@@ -300,6 +300,22 @@ export declare namespace InferenceSession {","      */","     validationMode?: 'disabled' | 'wgpuOnly' | 'basic' | 'full';"," ","+    /**","+     * Permit named ORT features when supported by the device; unsupported features use existing fallbacks.","+     * Supported feature: 'subgroupMatrix' (enabled by default). Options apply independently to each session,","+     * including sessions sharing a device. Omitted features use their defaults.","+     * Unknown names, duplicates, and names present in both lists are rejected.","+     */","+    enableFeatures?: readonly string[];","+","+    /**","+     * Prevent ORT from using named features, including with a custom GPU device.","+     * 'subgroupMatrix' uses existing fallback kernels when disabled. Options apply only to this session;","+     * other sessions sharing the device retain their own settings. This does not change the device's features.","+     * See enableFeatures for supported names and validation rules.","+     */","+    disableFeatures?: readonly string[];","+","     /**","      * Enable robust buffer access for an ORT-created Dawn device. This is a global, first-device-wins option. Later","      * conflicting values and values supplied with an external device are ignored with a warning."],"additions":16,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"js/node/src/session_options_helper.cc","lines":["@@ -106,6 +106,23 @@ void ParseExecutionProviders(const Napi::Array epList, Ort::SessionOptions& sess","               }","               value += v.As<Napi::String>().Utf8Value();","             }","+          } else if (name == \"enableFeatures\" || name == \"disableFeatures\") {","+            ORT_NAPI_THROW_TYPEERROR_IF(!valueVar.IsArray(), epList.Env(),","+                                        \"Invalid argument: \\\"\", name, \"\\\" must be a string array.\");","+            auto arr = valueVar.As<Napi::Array>();","+            for (uint32_t i = 0; i < arr.Length(); i++) {","+              Napi::Value v = arr[i];","+              ORT_NAPI_THROW_TYPEERROR_IF(!v.IsString(), epList.Env(),","+                                          \"Invalid argument: elements of \\\"\", name, \"\\\" must be strings.\");","+              const auto feature = v.As<Napi::String>().Utf8Value();","+              ORT_NAPI_THROW_TYPEERROR_IF(feature.empty() || feature.find_first_of(\",\\0\", 0, 2) != std::string::npos,","+                                          epList.Env(),","+                                          \"Invalid argument: \\\"\", name, \"\\\" has an invalid feature name.\");","+              if (i > 0) {","+                value += ',';","+              }","+              value += feature;","+            }","           } else {","             // unrecognized option","             ORT_NAPI_THROW_TYPEERROR_IF(name != \"name\", epList.Env(),"],"additions":17,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"js/node/test/api/simple-api-tests.ts","lines":["@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@ import assert from 'assert';"," import { InferenceSession, Tensor } from 'onnxruntime-common';"," import * as path from 'path';"," ","+import { binding } from '../../lib/binding';"," import { assertDataEqual, TEST_DATA_ROOT } from '../test-utils';"," "," const MODEL_TEST_TYPES_CASES: Array<{","@@ -119,6 +120,44 @@ describe('API Tests - simple API tests', () => {","     }","   });"," ","+  it('recognizes the WebGPU feature list options', async function (this: Mocha.Context) {","+    if (!binding.listSupportedBackends().some((backend) => backend.name === 'webgpu' && backend.bundled)) {","+      this.skip();","+    }","+    const model = path.join(TEST_DATA_ROOT, 'test_types_float.onnx');","+","+    for (const key of ['enableFeatures', 'disableFeatures'] as const) {","+      const session = new binding.InferenceSession();","+      try {","+        await session.loadModel(model, {","+          executionProviders: [{ name: 'webgpu', [key]: ['subgroupMatrix'] }],","+        });","+        session.dispose();","+      } catch (error) {","+        // A machine without a usable adapter can fail for unrelated reasons.","+        assert.doesNotMatch(String(error), /unrecognized option|must be a string array|must be strings/);","+      }","+    }","+  });","+","+  it('rejects malformed WebGPU feature arrays', async function (this: Mocha.Context) {","+    if (!binding.listSupportedBackends().some((backend) => backend.name === 'webgpu' && backend.bundled)) {","+      this.skip();","+    }","+    const model = path.join(TEST_DATA_ROOT, 'test_types_float.onnx');","+    for (const key of ['enableFeatures', 'disableFeatures'] as const) {","+      for (const value of ['subgroupMatrix', [1], [''], ['a,b'], ['a\\0b'], Array(1)]) {","+        const session = new binding.InferenceSession();","+        await assert.rejects(async () => {","+          await session.loadModel(model, {","+            executionProviders: [{ name: 'webgpu', [key]: value }],","+          });","+          session.dispose();","+        }, /must be a string array|must be strings|invalid feature name/);","+      }","+    }","+  });","+","   MODEL_TEST_TYPES_CASES.forEach((testCase) => {","     it(`${testCase.model}`, async () => {","       const session = await InferenceSession.create(testCase.model);"],"additions":39,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"js/web/lib/wasm/session-options.ts","lines":["@@ -197,6 +197,24 @@ const setExecutionProviders = async (","               appendEpOption(epOptions, 'validationMode', webgpuOptions.validationMode, allocs);","             }"," ","+            for (const key of ['enableFeatures', 'disableFeatures'] as const) {","+              const features = webgpuOptions[key];","+              if (features !== undefined) {","+                if (","+                  !Array.isArray(features) ||","+                  Array.from(features).some(","+                    (name) =>","+                      typeof name !== 'string' || name.length === 0 || name.includes(',') || name.includes('\\0'),","+                  )","+                ) {","+                  throw new Error(","+                    `${key} must be an array of nonempty feature names without commas or null characters.`,","+                  );","+                }","+                appendEpOption(epOptions, key, features.join(','), allocs);","+              }","+            }","+","             // set f32 accumulation for the MatMulNBits kernels","             if (typeof webgpuOptions.enableMatmulFp32Accumulation === 'boolean') {","               appendEpOption("],"additions":18,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/providers/webgpu/compute_context.h","lines":["@@ -76,7 +76,7 @@ class ComputeContextBase {","     return webgpu_context_.DeviceLimits();","   }","   inline bool HasFeature(wgpu::FeatureName feature) const {","-    return webgpu_context_.DeviceHasFeature(feature);","+    return ep_.DeviceHasFeature(feature);","   }","   inline bool HasWGSLLanguageFeature(wgpu::WGSLLanguageFeatureName feature) const {","     return webgpu_context_.Instance().HasWGSLLanguageFeature(feature);"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/providers/webgpu/webgpu_context.h","lines":["@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@"," #include <mutex>"," #include <optional>"," #include <string>","+#include <string_view>"," #include <unordered_set>"," #include <utility>"," #include <variant>"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/providers/webgpu/webgpu_execution_provider.cc","lines":["@@ -661,6 +661,7 @@ WebGpuExecutionProvider::WebGpuExecutionProvider(int context_id,","       multi_rotary_cache_concat_offset_{config.multi_rotary_cache_concat_offset},","       kv_cache_quantization_bits_{config.kv_cache_quantization_bits},","       enable_matmul_fp32_accumulation_{config.enable_matmul_fp32_accumulation},","+      feature_requests_{config.feature_requests},","       forced_matmul_algorithm_{config.forced_matmul_algorithm},"," #if defined(_WIN32) && defined(ENABLE_D3D12_FILE_LOADING)","       weight_load_acceleration_mode_{config.weight_load_acceleration_mode},","@@ -712,6 +713,13 @@ WebGpuExecutionProvider::WebGpuExecutionProvider(int context_id,","   WebGpuContextFactory::RetainContext(context_id_);"," }"," ","+bool WebGpuExecutionProvider::DeviceHasFeature(wgpu::FeatureName feature) const {","+  constexpr auto index = static_cast<size_t>(WebGpuFeature::SubgroupMatrix);","+  return context_.DeviceHasFeature(feature) &&","+         (feature != wgpu::FeatureName::ChromiumExperimentalSubgroupMatrix ||","+          feature_requests_[index].value_or(kWebGpuFeatures[index].enabled_by_default));","+}","+"," std::vector<AllocatorPtr> WebGpuExecutionProvider::CreatePreferredAllocators() {","   const bool device_free = !context_.HasDevice();","   return {"],"additions":8,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/providers/webgpu/webgpu_execution_provider.h","lines":["@@ -70,6 +70,7 @@ struct WebGpuExecutionProviderConfig {","   // This is the single line that decides the shipped default for the","   // \"enableMatmulFp32Accumulation\" provider option.","   bool enable_matmul_fp32_accumulation{false};","+  webgpu::WebGpuFeatureRequests feature_requests{};","   std::optional<webgpu::MatMulAlgorithm> forced_matmul_algorithm;","   std::vector<std::string> force_cpu_node_names{};"," };","@@ -137,6 +138,7 @@ class WebGpuExecutionProvider : public IExecutionProvider {","   uint32_t KvCacheQuantizationBits() const { return kv_cache_quantization_bits_; }","   bool KvCacheQuantizationEnabled() const { return kv_cache_quantization_bits_ != 0; }","   bool EnableMatmulFp32Accumulation() const { return enable_matmul_fp32_accumulation_; }","+  bool DeviceHasFeature(wgpu::FeatureName feature) const;","   std::optional<webgpu::MatMulAlgorithm> ForcedMatMulAlgorithm() const { return forced_matmul_algorithm_; }"," "," #if defined(ORT_USE_EP_API_ADAPTERS)","@@ -160,6 +162,7 @@ class WebGpuExecutionProvider : public IExecutionProvider {","   uint32_t multi_rotary_cache_concat_offset_ = 0;","   uint32_t kv_cache_quantization_bits_ = 0;","   bool enable_matmul_fp32_accumulation_ = false;","+  const webgpu::WebGpuFeatureRequests feature_requests_;","   std::optional<webgpu::MatMulAlgorithm> forced_matmul_algorithm_;"," #if defined(_WIN32) && defined(ENABLE_D3D12_FILE_LOADING)","   webgpu::WeightLoadAccelerationMode weight_load_acceleration_mode_{"],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/providers/webgpu/webgpu_provider_factory.cc","lines":["@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@"," // Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved."," // Licensed under the MIT License."," ","+#include <algorithm>"," #include <charconv>"," #include <limits>"," ","@@ -104,6 +105,32 @@ WebGpuExecutionProviderConfig ParseEpConfig(","     WeightLoadAccelerationMode weight_load_acceleration_mode) {","   WebGpuExecutionProviderConfig webgpu_ep_config{};"," ","+  for (const auto& [key, enabled] : {std::pair{kEnableFeatures, true}, std::pair{kDisableFeatures, false}}) {","+    std::string value;","+    if (!config_options.TryGetConfigEntry(key, value) || value.empty()) {","+      continue;","+    }","+    std::string_view remaining{value};","+    while (true) {","+      const auto separator = remaining.find(',');","+      auto name = remaining.substr(0, separator);","+      constexpr std::string_view kWhitespace = \" \\t\\r\\n\";","+      name.remove_prefix(std::min(name.find_first_not_of(kWhitespace), name.size()));","+      name.remove_suffix(name.size() - (name.find_last_not_of(kWhitespace) + 1));","+      const auto feature = std::find_if(kWebGpuFeatures.begin(), kWebGpuFeatures.end(),","+                                        [name](const auto& entry) { return entry.name == name; });","+      ORT_ENFORCE(feature != kWebGpuFeatures.end(), \"Unknown WebGPU feature: \", name);","+      const auto index = static_cast<size_t>(feature - kWebGpuFeatures.begin());","+      ORT_ENFORCE(!webgpu_ep_config.feature_requests[index].has_value(),","+                  \"Duplicate or conflicting WebGPU feature: \", name);","+      webgpu_ep_config.feature_requests[index] = enabled;","+      if (separator == std::string_view::npos) {","+        break;","+      }","+      remaining.remove_prefix(separator + 1);","+    }","+  }","+","   if (std::string preferred_layout_str;","       config_options.TryGetConfigEntry(kPreferredLayout, preferred_layout_str)) {","     if (preferred_layout_str == kPreferredLayout_NHWC) {"],"additions":27,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/providers/webgpu/webgpu_provider_options.h","lines":["@@ -3,9 +3,30 @@"," "," #pragma once"," ","+#include <array>","+#include <cstddef>","+#include <optional>","+#include <string_view>","+"," namespace onnxruntime {"," namespace webgpu {"," ","+// Named WebGPU EP features controlled by enableFeatures/disableFeatures. Keep in sync with kWebGpuFeatures.","+enum class WebGpuFeature : size_t {","+  SubgroupMatrix,","+  Count,","+};","+","+struct WebGpuFeatureDefinition {","+  std::string_view name;","+  bool enabled_by_default;","+};","+","+inline constexpr std::array<WebGpuFeatureDefinition, static_cast<size_t>(WebGpuFeature::Count)> kWebGpuFeatures{{","+    {\"subgroupMatrix\", true},","+}};","+using WebGpuFeatureRequests = std::array<std::optional<bool>, kWebGpuFeatures.size()>;","+"," enum class WeightLoadAccelerationMode {","   Off,","   Preferred,","@@ -66,6 +87,10 @@ constexpr const char* kDefaultBufferCacheMode = \"ep.webgpuexecutionprovider.defa"," "," constexpr const char* kValidationMode = \"ep.webgpuexecutionprovider.validationMode\";"," constexpr const char* kEnableRobustness = \"ep.webgpuexecutionprovider.enableRobustness\";","+// Comma-separated names, trimmed of surrounding whitespace. Empty lists preserve defaults.","+// See kWebGpuFeatures for supported names.","+constexpr const char* kEnableFeatures = \"ep.webgpuexecutionprovider.enableFeatures\";","+constexpr const char* kDisableFeatures = \"ep.webgpuexecutionprovider.disableFeatures\";"," "," constexpr const char* kForceCpuNodeNames = \"ep.webgpuexecutionprovider.forceCpuNodeNames\";"," constexpr const char* kEnablePIXCapture = \"ep.webgpuexecutionprovider.enablePIXCapture\";"],"additions":25,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/test/providers/webgpu/webgpu_context_test.cc","lines":["@@ -1486,6 +1486,97 @@ TEST(WebGpuContextTest, EnableRobustnessRejectsInvalidValue) {","   EXPECT_THROW(WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(RobustnessOptions(\"true\")), OnnxRuntimeException);"," }"," ","+TEST(WebGpuContextTest, FeatureListsRejectInvalidEntries) {","+  for (const auto* key : {kEnableFeatures, kDisableFeatures}) {","+    for (const char* value : {\"unknown\", \"subgroupMatrix,subgroupMatrix\", \"subgroupMatrix,\", \",subgroupMatrix\"}) {","+      ConfigOptions options;","+      ASSERT_STATUS_OK(options.AddConfigEntry(key, value));","+      EXPECT_THROW(WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(options), OnnxRuntimeException);","+    }","+  }","+  ConfigOptions options;","+  ASSERT_STATUS_OK(options.AddConfigEntry(kEnableFeatures, \"subgroupMatrix\"));","+  ASSERT_STATUS_OK(options.AddConfigEntry(kDisableFeatures, \"subgroupMatrix\"));","+  EXPECT_THROW(WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(options), OnnxRuntimeException);","+}","+","+TEST(WebGpuContextTest, EnableFeaturesRespectsHardwareCapabilities) {","+  RunWithFreshDefaultContext([]() {","+    ConfigOptions options;","+    ASSERT_STATUS_OK(options.AddConfigEntry(kEnableFeatures, \"subgroupMatrix\"));","+    ASSERT_STATUS_OK(options.AddConfigEntry(kDisableFeatures, \"\"));","+    auto default_ep = WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(ConfigOptions{})->CreateProvider();","+    auto ep = WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(options)->CreateProvider();","+    auto& context = webgpu::WebGpuContextFactory::GetContext(0);","+    const auto feature = wgpu::FeatureName::ChromiumExperimentalSubgroupMatrix;","+    EXPECT_EQ(static_cast<WebGpuExecutionProvider&>(*ep).DeviceHasFeature(feature),","+              context.Device().HasFeature(feature));","+    EXPECT_EQ(context.DeviceHasFeature(feature), context.Device().HasFeature(feature));","+    ConfigOptions conflicting_options;","+    ASSERT_STATUS_OK(conflicting_options.AddConfigEntry(kDisableFeatures, \"subgroupMatrix\"));","+    auto disabled_ep = WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(conflicting_options)->CreateProvider();","+    EXPECT_FALSE(static_cast<WebGpuExecutionProvider&>(*disabled_ep).DeviceHasFeature(feature));","+    EXPECT_EQ(static_cast<WebGpuExecutionProvider&>(*default_ep).DeviceHasFeature(feature),","+              context.Device().HasFeature(feature));","+  });","+}","+","+TEST(WebGpuContextTest, DisableFeaturesDoesNotRestrictLaterSessions) {","+  RunWithFreshDefaultContext([]() {","+    ConfigOptions options;","+    ASSERT_STATUS_OK(options.AddConfigEntry(kDisableFeatures, \"subgroupMatrix\"));","+    auto ep = WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(options)->CreateProvider();","+    auto& context = webgpu::WebGpuContextFactory::GetContext(0);","+    const auto feature = wgpu::FeatureName::ChromiumExperimentalSubgroupMatrix;","+    const auto device = context.Device().Get();","+    EXPECT_FALSE(static_cast<WebGpuExecutionProvider&>(*ep).DeviceHasFeature(feature));","+    EXPECT_EQ(context.DeviceHasFeature(feature), context.Device().HasFeature(feature));","+    auto matching_ep = WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(options)->CreateProvider();","+    auto omitted_ep = WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(ConfigOptions{})->CreateProvider();","+    EXPECT_EQ(static_cast<WebGpuExecutionProvider&>(*omitted_ep).DeviceHasFeature(feature),","+              context.Device().HasFeature(feature));","+    ConfigOptions conflicting_options;","+    ASSERT_STATUS_OK(conflicting_options.AddConfigEntry(kEnableFeatures, \"subgroupMatrix\"));","+    auto enabled_ep = WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(conflicting_options)->CreateProvider();","+    EXPECT_EQ(static_cast<WebGpuExecutionProvider&>(*enabled_ep).DeviceHasFeature(feature),","+              context.Device().HasFeature(feature));","+    EXPECT_FALSE(static_cast<WebGpuExecutionProvider&>(*ep).DeviceHasFeature(feature));","+    EXPECT_EQ(context.Device().Get(), device);","+  });","+}","+","+TEST(WebGpuContextTest, DisableFeaturesMasksExternalDeviceFeature) {","+  ConfigOptions default_options;","+  auto default_ep = WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(default_options)->CreateProvider();","+  if (!webgpu::WebGpuContextFactory::GetContext(0).Device().HasFeature(","+          wgpu::FeatureName::ChromiumExperimentalSubgroupMatrix)) {","+    GTEST_SKIP() << \"The adapter does not support subgroup matrices.\";","+  }","+  RunWithFreshDefaultContext([]() {","+    ConfigOptions options;","+    ASSERT_STATUS_OK(options.AddConfigEntry(kEnableFeatures, \"subgroupMatrix\"));","+    auto ep = WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(options)->CreateProvider();","+    auto& context = webgpu::WebGpuContextFactory::GetContext(0);","+    const auto feature = wgpu::FeatureName::ChromiumExperimentalSubgroupMatrix;","+    EXPECT_EQ(context.DeviceHasFeature(feature), context.Device().HasFeature(feature));","+    ASSERT_TRUE(context.Device().HasFeature(feature));","+","+    ConfigOptions external_options;","+    ASSERT_STATUS_OK(external_options.AddConfigEntry(kDeviceId, \"1\"));","+    ASSERT_STATUS_OK(external_options.AddConfigEntry(kDisableFeatures, \"subgroupMatrix\"));","+    ASSERT_STATUS_OK(external_options.AddConfigEntry(","+        kWebGpuInstance, std::to_string(reinterpret_cast<uintptr_t>(context.Instance().Get())).c_str()));","+    ASSERT_STATUS_OK(external_options.AddConfigEntry(","+        kWebGpuDevice, std::to_string(reinterpret_cast<uintptr_t>(context.Device().Get())).c_str()));","+    auto external_ep = WebGpuProviderFactoryCreator::Create(external_options)->CreateProvider();","+    auto& external_context = webgpu::WebGpuContextFactory::GetContext(1);","+    EXPECT_TRUE(external_context.Device().HasFeature(feature));","+    EXPECT_TRUE(external_context.DeviceHasFeature(feature));","+    EXPECT_FALSE(static_cast<WebGpuExecutionProvider&>(*external_ep).DeviceHasFeature(feature));","+    EXPECT_TRUE(context.DeviceHasFeature(feature));","+  });","+}","+"," TEST(WebGpuContextTest, KvCacheQuantizationAcceptsSupportedBitWidths) {","   for (const auto& [value, expected_bits] :","        std::array<std::pair<const char*, uint32_t>, 3>{{{\"0\", 0}, {\"4\", 4}, {\"8\", 8}}}) {",""],"additions":91,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":285,"deletions":1,"truncated":false,"file_count":12},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-05T16:30:18.482250+00:00"}